 "npcs": [
  {
   "index": 0,
   "raw": "b100811c01030000",
   "x": 177,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 1,
   "headTile": "0x1c",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 0,
   "text": "Welcome. You must be cold. Helada used to be a warm, prosperous place, but Jashiin has turned it into a cold ruin."
  },
  {
   "index": 1,
   "raw": "8b00830000050004",
   "x": 139,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 3,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 5,
   "aiName": "bounce_1bit",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 4,
   "text": "I think you should know something: Percel the shoemaker said that without the Ruzeria shoes you could not go beyond the green door."
  },
  {
   "index": 2,
   "raw": "6900020001038003",
   "x": 105,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 2,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x80",
   "autoTalk": true,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 3,
   "text": "Are you the brave one? My lover, Percel, was killed by Jashiin's underlings just after the Spirits asked him to make the Ruzeria shoes for a brave man. Return my Percel to me! Oh, if only you had not come!"
  },
  {
   "index": 3,
   "raw": "a600830000050002",
   "x": 166,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 3,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 5,
   "aiName": "bounce_1bit",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 2,
   "text": "Have you been in the ice caverns? The shoemaker in this town was trying to make special shoes out of Ruzeria bark, to help a hero walk on the ice. Just as he managed to do so, Jashiin's minions murdered him. I wonder what happened to those shoes."
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "raw": "4800831b00010005",
   "x": 72,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 3,
   "headTile": "0x1b",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 1,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_2nd_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 5,
   "text": "Ruzeria is the name of a tree that grows in the underground forest. The bark is very hard and is not slippery. Percel had good reason for choosing it."
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "raw": "9e00820000020006",
   "x": 158,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 2,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 2,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_4th_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 6,
   "text": "Someone I know said he had seen a pair of unusual shoes in the caverns. I'm not sure whether those are the shoes that Percel made."
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "raw": "380081000103000a",
   "x": 56,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 1,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 10,
   "text": "I'll bet the green slime creatures have caused you a lot of trouble. Let me tell you a secret: they can't withstand heat. Burn them and they will vanish in a single burst of steam."
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "raw": "5000810001060001",
   "x": 80,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 1,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 6,
   "aiName": "bounce_2bit",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 1,
   "text": "You may have noticed that there are two roads leading here. There is also a shortcut."
  }
 ],
