  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "text": "I'm sorry for what I said a short while ago. I don't know what came over me. Please defeat Jashiin and avenge the death of Percel.",
   "controlCodes": [],
   "raw": "495c6d20736f72727920666f7220776861742049207361696420612073686f7274207768696c652061676f2e204920646f6e5c74206b6e6f7720776861742063616d65206f766572206d652e20506c6561736520646566656174204a61736869696e20616e64206176656e676520746865206465617468206f662050657263656c2e"
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "text": "Ah, the shoes of Percel.... I see you are a brave man. I hope you will find Jashiin and defeat him quickly.",
   "controlCodes": [],
